    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the Cylinder lingers: a creature it moves into, or that enters it or ends its turn there, makes the save (once a turn). <strong>Move the Beam</strong> (a Magic action) moves it up to 60 feet to a point you place; creatures it passes over are moved into. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>moonbeam</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
